Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,One plate of khaman, and Amdavad and Surat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,face off in the family group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pappa writes: I'm bringing khaman for Sunday breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:11.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mummy, instantly: only Amdavadi khaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:15.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fai writes from Surat: khaman means Surat's,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,with butter and sev.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mummy: butter on khaman? What's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jay asks from America: we get frozen khaman here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will that do? Fai and Mummy, together: no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:34.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Ba writes: I'll make the khaman at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who's bringing chutney?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the whole group goes quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:43.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on, Amdavad or Surat? Comment below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo. Follow Otlo.
